# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party source. NOT committed.
# Four of the imported repositories ship no LICENSE (FLAG, BWGNN, DGA-GNN, PMP),
# so this project must not re-host their code. Reconstruct with:
#     bash scripts/setup/fetch_methods.sh
# Provenance is pinned in research/repository_provenance.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
methods/*
!methods/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data. Never committed - large, and subject to upstream terms
# (Reddit content terms; the Instagram influencer dataset is research-use-only).
# Manifests and checksums ARE committed so builds stay traceable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/dataset_manifest.json
!data/**/*.sha256
!data/**/.gitkeep

# Same rule for datasets/ (the fraud_text YelpChi/Amazon raw + processed dumps) -- this
# directory was accidentally committed once (commit 2166e57): 246MB of datasets/raw/ plus
# 616MB of datasets/processed/, including a 116MB file that GitHub hard-rejects outright
# (100MB limit). Manifests are small and traceable, so they stay tracked.
datasets/**
!datasets/**/
!datasets/VERSIONS.md
!datasets/manifests/**
!datasets/**/.gitkeep

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
cache/**
!cache/**/
!cache/**/.gitkeep
checkpoints/**
!checkpoints/**/
!checkpoints/**/.gitkeep
logs/**
!logs/**/
!logs/**/.gitkeep

# Results: keep aggregated tables and figures, drop per-run raw dumps.
results/raw/
!results/**/.gitkeep

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environments
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv*/
venv/
env/
ENV/
conda-meta/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. NEVER commit real tokens - HuggingFace tokens are needed for the
# gated google/gemma-2-9b-it checkpoint. Use .env, which is ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
**/hf_token*
**/*credentials*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model weights and large binaries
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.h5
*.onnx
*.npy
*.npz
*.7z
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
eggs/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.hypothesis/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Experiment trackers
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
wandb/
mlruns/
lightning_logs/
outputs/
.hydra/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
scratch/
tmp/
*.tmp
*.log
!logs/**/README.md